    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>MagiChaos is a bullet hell shooting party game that can be enjoyed by up to four players! Experience the &quot;Magic&quot; and &quot;Chaos&quot; bullet battles with cute magical girls!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/ca44c97c8986347243ef3c36f3048ba8.poster.avif?t=1709892109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/ca44c97c8986347243ef3c36f3048ba8.webm?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/ca44c97c8986347243ef3c36f3048ba8.mp4?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find Your Unique Combination!</h2>Choose from over 10 bullet skill types! <br>There are two types: main and sub. Bullets set as main can be charged for a powerful shot.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07bb0a3b8d0f4da39f8f97c361dd875d.poster.avif?t=1709892109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07bb0a3b8d0f4da39f8f97c361dd875d.webm?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07bb0a3b8d0f4da39f8f97c361dd875d.mp4?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Magical girls have unique abilities to tilt battles in their favor. <br>Whether it's creating ice walls or teleporting, let's aim for victory with all sorts of tactics!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07f762235a1449f5c20ba39114a800d6.poster.avif?t=1709892109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07f762235a1449f5c20ba39114a800d6.webm?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07f762235a1449f5c20ba39114a800d6.mp4?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/f07cf8656e99a3c9ace394de01bf2d8d.poster.avif?t=1709892109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/f07cf8656e99a3c9ace394de01bf2d8d.webm?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/f07cf8656e99a3c9ace394de01bf2d8d.mp4?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "MagiChaos is a bullet hell shooting party game that can be enjoyed by up to four players! Experience the &quot;Magic&quot; and &quot;Chaos&quot; bullet battles with cute magical girls!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/ca44c97c8986347243ef3c36f3048ba8.poster.avif?t=1709892109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/ca44c97c8986347243ef3c36f3048ba8.webm?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/ca44c97c8986347243ef3c36f3048ba8.mp4?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find Your Unique Combination!</h2>Choose from over 10 bullet skill types! <br>There are two types: main and sub. Bullets set as main can be charged for a powerful shot.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07bb0a3b8d0f4da39f8f97c361dd875d.poster.avif?t=1709892109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07bb0a3b8d0f4da39f8f97c361dd875d.webm?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07bb0a3b8d0f4da39f8f97c361dd875d.mp4?t=1709892109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Magical girls have unique abilities to tilt battles in their favor. <br>Whether it's creating ice walls or teleporting, let's aim for victory with all sorts of tactics!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785220/extras/07f762235a1449f5c20ba39114a800d6.poster